OL,3,AWill Atiku Abubakar be on Nigeria's
OL,4,Apresidential ballot after court ruling?
OL,5,
OL,6,FNigeria's Federal High Court has sacked
OL,7,Fthe leadership of the opposition
OL,8,FAfrican Democratic Congress (ADC) party
OL,9,F- and also ruled that the nomination of
OL,10,Fits presidential candidate, former
OL,11,FVice-President Atiku Abubakar, is
OL,12,Finvalid.
OL,14,FA statement from the ADC said the
OL,15,Fruling was another desperate attempt to
OL,16,Fcripple the opposition.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
