OL,3,AWill Atiku Abubakar be on Nigeria's
OL,4,Apresidential ballot after court ruling?
OL,5,
OL,6,FPresidential elections are scheduled to
OL,7,Ftake place on 16 January when President
OL,8,FBola Tinubu's main challengers are
OL,9,Fagain expected to be Abubakar and
OL,10,Fformer Anambra State Governor Peter
OL,11,FObi.
OL,13,FSeveral high-profile politicians joined
OL,14,Fthe ADC in 2025 - disillusioned by the
OL,15,Ffactional infighting in the once
OL,16,Fpowerful Peoples Democratic Party
OL,17,F(PDP).
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
